{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaaty/mobile_notallowed

    The home of Aty for someone whose plan does not include the app: why, and where to go.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * message - Why.
    * url - The site, which opens in the browser.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "message": "Your organisation's plan does not include the app.",
        "url": "https://example.com"
    }
}}
<div class="aty-home">
    <p>{{message}}</p>
    <ion-button expand="block" class="ion-margin-top" core-link href="{{url}}" capture="false">
        {{#str}} appnotallowed:browser, local_oksigeniaaty {{/str}}
    </ion-button>
</div>
